    "title": "Concede a point, then contrast",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-contrast-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Concede a point, then contrast",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "但是 or 可是 introduces a contrast. 虽然 concedes a true point before the contrasting conclusion; the second clause should actually differ from what that point might lead us to expect.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "虽然下雨，但是我想去。",
                "pinyin": "suīrán xiàyǔ ， dànshì wǒ xiǎng qù 。",
                "meaning": "Although it is raining, I want to go.",
                "audio": "d6e03ba94b027bc959e77e8845aba40480787a773fd54d3f1e4cbd9e47d8b6a8"
              },
              {
                "text": "我想去，可是没有时间。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ xiǎng qù ， kěshì méiyǒu shíjiān 。",
                "meaning": "I want to go, but I have no time.",
                "audio": "b2fc95d8bb4132c497fe31035970fbcbcfb8f18a7e19515b27963740ff925288"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
            "examples": [
